 before write_file</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">↷ Kept your hand-edits: src/config.py, notes.md</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">Use /rollback &lt;N&gt; --all to restore those too.</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">/rollback 1 --all</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">/rollback 1 src/broken_file.py</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">~/.hermes/checkpoints/</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  ├── store/                 # single shared bare git repo</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  │   ├── HEAD, objects/     # git internals (shared across projects)</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  │   ├── refs/hermes/&lt;hash&gt; # per-project branch tip</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  │   ├── indexes/&lt;hash&gt;     # per-project git index</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  │   ├── projects/&lt;hash&gt;.json  # workdir + created_at + 